    <innerclass refid="class_patch_shape" prot="public">PatchShape</innerclass>
    <briefdescription>
<para>Defines the <ref refid="class_patch_shape" kindref="compound">PatchShape</ref> base class for patches in the landscape. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This file contains the <ref refid="class_patch_shape" kindref="compound">PatchShape</ref> abstract base class, which represents a generic patch shape in the landscape. Derived classes implement specific geometries such as Cubic, Spherical, Gaussian, or Homogeneous patches. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
